        "C": "Because concealment can only occur through physical walls, and since Avidyā has no physical bricks, it cannot conceal Brahman.",
        "D": "Because Brahman is concealed only from the perspective of animals, but since humans possess reason, concealment is an epistemic impossibility.\n\n---"
