      "question": "Match the technical post-structuralist or critical term in **List-I** with its precise conceptual formulation in **List-II**:\n\n| List-I (Term) | List-II (Philosophical Formulation) |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **p. *Pharmakon*** | **1.** An idealized speech situation characterized by communicative symmetry, where force is replaced solely by the \"forceless force of the better argument\" (*zwangloser Zwang des besseren Arguments*). |\n| **q. *Il n'y a pas de hors-texte*** | **2.** An undecidable textual element that operates simultaneously as both a healing medicine and a deadly poison, resisting binary metaphysical categorization. |\n| **r. Ideal Speech Situation** | **3.** The historical process wherein the systemic steering media of money and bureaucratic power invade the communicative sphere of symbolic reproduction, eroding mutual understanding. |\n| **s. Colonization of the Lifeworld** | **4.** The hermeneutic thesis that there is no accessible ontological reality outside the differential network of referential signs and interpretive contexts. |\n\nChoose the correct matching code:",
