          "question": "In Sankara's *Adhyasabhasya* (preamble to the *Brahmasutra-bhasya*), *adhyasa* (superimposition) is defined as *smrtirupah paratra purvadrstavabhasah*. In this classic definition, the compound term *paratra* signifies:",
